  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 518.20 Issuance of Inventory",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 518.20 Issuance of Inventory. Registration inventory shall be issued by a municipal agent in the numerical sequence in which they are received from the department. In all cases, the lowest-numbered inventory in the municipal agent's possession shall be issued before any inventory with a higher number is issued.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 519.20)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
